WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:04.880
In one cross-test, the Foundation thought&nbsp;
SCP-682, the Hard to Destroy Reptile, would&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:10.720
bite off more than it could chew with SCP-807,&nbsp;
a deadly plate from the Last Chance Diner.

00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:15.120
This plate makes any food placed on it&nbsp;
extra delicious, but also makes them extra&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:20.080
unhealthy - so unhealthy that people who eat&nbsp;
its food tend to die of massive heart attacks.

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:25.360
They used the plate to transmute two&nbsp;
SCP-682 Specials - a mix of 10 kg of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:31.280
rotten meat and sharpened bone splinters, 10&nbsp;
L of rancid mayonnaise, 1 L potassium cyanide,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:35.840
and 1 kg morphine hydrochloride -&nbsp;
considered a 5-star course for our pal&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:38.800
SCP-682 - and fed it to the beast.

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:43.600
At first, it seemed immobile. Perhaps the&nbsp;
monster had been bested? But when D-Classes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:46.960
entered to check, the creature’s&nbsp;
skin ruptured in several areas,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:46.960 --> 00:00:50.320
ejecting high-pressure jets of&nbsp;
its own blood in every direction,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:57.040
killing them all. The reptile was completely fine&nbsp;
afterward and eagerly ate a third 682 Special.

